# Environment files. Only *.example is ever committed.
# Deliberately broad: backup copies left by deploy and rotation tooling are
# named inconsistently (.env.bak-<ts>, .env.va-bak, config.env.old), and a
# narrow .env* rule silently misses them.
.env*
!.env*.example
*.env
*.env.*
!*.env*.example
env
env.*
!env*.example

.vercel
